# Local-only secrets for `vite dev` / `wrangler dev`.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and fill in as needed.
# NEVER commit real secrets. Production secrets are set with `wrangler secret put`.
#
# Phase 0 needs none of these. They become relevant later:
#
# --- Optional: drizzle-kit studio against remote D1 (Phase 0.5+) ---
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_DATABASE_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_D1_TOKEN=""
#
# --- Single-user login (Phase 3). Leave unset for open local dev. ---
# Set AUTH_SECRET to ANY non-empty value to turn the login gate ON locally; the
# username + password live in D1 (seed them with: node scripts/setup-login.mjs --local).
# AUTH_SECRET="any-non-empty-string-locally"
